            "condition_id": "hc_regime",
            "statement": "The system is in the Heat Coulomb Blockade (HCB) regime where k_B T << hbar G_0 / C, so charge on each island is frozen and current noise cannot flow through the capacitance."
          },
          {
            "condition_id": "source_drain_temps",
            "statement": "Source and drain temperatures are T_S = 35 mK and T_D = 15 mK, used in the figures and examples."
          },
